schema StandingAddress
generation surface-1
authority engine/core/src/standing_address.c
absorbs components/BonfyreControlPlane/standing_address.py

field opportunity
  type record
  role addressed-action
  required true

invariant attention-reorders-only
  statement attention may alter rank but cannot create an opportunity or open an obligation

invariant availability-outranks-relevance
  statement unavailable opportunities rank below every available opportunity regardless of attention

forbidden_inference attention -> intent
forbidden_inference ranked opportunity -> authorized action
